        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 84052RECUS4SMUS26, Polished Chrome Cabinet Handle with Satin Brass Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Chrome and Brass Cabinet Pull has a distinctive retro flair, perfect for historic homes or those who want a little of the mid-century modern aesthetic added to their kitchen cabinets. The Polished Chrome Cabinet Handle with Satin Brass Mounts is available in a wide range of sizes from 3.5 inches all the way up to 54 inch center to centers. The Emtek Select Smooth Cabinet Pull comes packaged with mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-RECKN-specifications.gif?v=1774579972\" width=\"600\" height=\"157\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Smooth Cabinet Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Select Smooth Cabinet Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Stem Mount Finish: <b>Satin Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Bar Pull Finish: <b>Polished Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-84052-specifications.pdf?v=1704262418\"><b>Emtek Select Cabinet Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 13 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-84052:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84053:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84054:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84055:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<b>EMT-84056:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84057:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84058:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84059:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>3 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 16-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84062:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>2 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84060:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>3 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84061:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>3 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84063:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>3 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84064:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>4 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 54-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
